{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidental\/value"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidental\/value"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","title":"value","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLAccidentalV5valueAA0C5ValueOvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidental"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","text":"MXLAccidentalValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidental/value":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"value","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidental\/value","abstract":[{"text":"The value of this element.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidental\/value"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalValue":{"title":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The accidental-value type represents notated accidentals supported by MusicXML. In the MusicXML 2.0 DTD this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"was a string with values that could be included. The XSD strengthens the data typing to an enumerated list.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The quarter- and three-quarters- accidentals are Tartini-style quarter-tone accidentals. The -down and -up","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accidentals are quarter-tone accidentals that include arrows pointing down or up. The slash- accidentals are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"used in Turkish classical music. The numbered sharp and flat accidentals are superscripted versions of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accidental signs, used in Turkish folk music. The sori and koron accidentals are microtonal sharp and flat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accidentals used in Iranian and Persian music. The other accidental covers accidentals other than those listed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"here. It is usually used in combination with the smufl attribute to specify a particular SMuFL accidental. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"smufl attribute may be used with any accidental value to help specify the appearance of symbols that share the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same MusicXML semantics.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentalvalue"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidental":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The accidental type represents actual notated accidentals. Editorial and cautionary indications are indicated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by attributes. Values for these attributes are “no” if not present. Specific graphic display such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parentheses, brackets, and size are controlled by the level-display attribute group."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLAccidental","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLAccidental","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLAccidental","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidental","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidental","kind":"symbol"}}}